      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 5.07,
          "en": "So creating messages means storing data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.07,
          "end": 6.99,
          "en": "in our Vuex store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.99,
          "end": 10.09,
          "en": "Thus far, we only got our coaches module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.09,
          "end": 13.43,
          "en": "Now, of course, we also need a module for requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.43,
          "end": 16.6,
          "en": "because we also wanna manage requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.6,
          "end": 20.11,
          "en": "So in the store, modules folder, under requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.11,
          "end": 24.28,
          "en": "I'll create an index.JS fault just as I did it in coaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.28,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "And I'll also create all the other files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 31.52,
          "en": "mutations.JS, getters.JS, and actions.JS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33,
          "end": 36.5,
          "en": "Again, it's up to you whether you want this layout or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.5,
          "end": 37.92,
          "en": "but I'll go for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.92,
          "end": 40.753,
          "en": "also to be in line with my coaches setup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.86,
          "end": 45.35,
          "en": "Now in index.JS here in the requests folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.35,
          "end": 50.32,
          "en": "we then export an object and we import that object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.32,
          "end": 53.93,
          "en": "from index.JS in requests into our main store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.93,
          "end": 57.34,
          "en": "in this index.JS file in the store folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.34,
          "end": 60.49,
          "en": "So here just as we imported the coaches module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.49,
          "end": 62.59,
          "en": "we can import the requests module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.59,
          "end": 66.853,
          "en": "from modules, requests, index.JS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.65,
          "end": 72.96000000000001,
          "en": "and then simply add the requests key here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.96000000000001,
          "end": 75.45,
          "en": "in the modules object in our store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 75.45,
          "end": 77.663,
          "en": "and point at requests module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79.17,
          "end": 82.21000000000001,
          "en": "Now, instead of this exported object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 82.21000000000001,
          "end": 84.64,
          "en": "I will now also set namespace to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.64,
          "end": 87.83,
          "en": "so that we use namespacing for this module as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.83,
          "end": 91.22,
          "en": "and we don't just merge it into the global state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.22,
          "end": 93.22999999999999,
          "en": "into the global store, which we could do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.22999999999999,
          "end": 94.94,
          "en": "but which I don't wanna do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.94,
          "end": 99.03,
          "en": "And then we need to bring in our mutations hands on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.03,
          "end": 101.50999999999999,
          "en": "But first of all, we need a state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.50999999999999,
          "end": 104.91,
          "en": "We need a state in this module, and that state should manage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.91,
          "end": 109.28999999999999,
          "en": "one simple thing, our requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.28999999999999,
          "end": 113.57,
          "en": "So all the requests we know, and then every request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.57,
          "end": 117.47999999999999,
          "en": "will have a certain coach ID attached to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.47999999999999,
          "end": 121.63,
          "en": "and then later, if that coach ID matches our ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 121.63,
          "end": 123.6,
          "en": "that's a request we'll see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.6,
          "end": 126.363,
          "en": "all the other requests will be invisible to us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 128.31,
          "end": 132.18,
          "en": "So now that's our state and array of requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 132.18,
          "end": 135.38,
          "en": "Now, of course, since we already are fetching data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.38,
          "end": 138.4,
          "en": "for our request in the contactCoach component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 138.4,
          "end": 141.34,
          "en": "we now need a mutation and an action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.34,
          "end": 143.45,
          "en": "for creating a new request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.45,
          "end": 146.56,
          "en": "So let's start with the mutation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.56,
          "end": 150.32,
          "en": "Here in mutations.JS, we also export an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 150.32,
          "end": 154.01,
          "en": "And in here we can add addRequest mutation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.01,
          "end": 155.71,
          "en": "sounds like a fitting name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.71,
          "end": 159.59300000000002,
          "en": "where we get our state, like in all mutations and a payload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.44,
          "end": 163.28,
          "en": "which in the end will hold the request data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.28,
          "end": 166.46,
          "en": "And then we can simply reach out to state.requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.46,
          "end": 169.87,
          "en": "and push the payload onto this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.87,
          "end": 173.34,
          "en": "assuming that the payload already is the finished request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.34,
          "end": 174.543,
          "en": "as we wanna add it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.92000000000002,
          "end": 178.94,
          "en": "And that's done already here for the mutation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.94,
          "end": 180.77,
          "en": "Now, let's add an action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.77,
          "end": 185.77,
          "en": "So here we export an object as well in the actions file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.87,
          "end": 188.65,
          "en": "and we could name this action, contactCoach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.9,
          "end": 194.42,
          "en": "Now we will get our context here and also probably a payload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.42,
          "end": 197.9,
          "en": "because we need that data that was fetched from the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.9,
          "end": 199.743,
          "en": "in the contactCoach component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.96,
          "end": 205.96,
          "en": "Then we can create a new request here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 206.44,
          "end": 211.44,
          "en": "which can be an object where we can add a user email field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 211.66,
          "end": 214.61,
          "en": "where we point at payload email, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.61,
          "end": 217.32999999999998,
          "en": "assuming that the payload we get is an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.32999999999998,
          "end": 220.81,
          "en": "with an email field and add a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 220.81,
          "end": 223.233,
          "en": "where we point at payload.message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.23,
          "end": 226.79,
          "en": "But there's one more thing we need to add here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.79,
          "end": 230.09,
          "en": "And that's the coach ID because every request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.09,
          "end": 233.47,
          "en": "needs to be attached to a coach ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 233.47,
          "end": 235.63,
          "en": "So for that, I wanna get to the idea of the coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.63,
          "end": 238.21,
          "en": "to whom this request was sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.21,
          "end": 241.43,
          "en": "And therefore here, I assume that this is all the part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 241.43,
          "end": 245.16,
          "en": "of the incoming payload, the coach ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 245.16,
          "end": 248.13,
          "en": "And then we just wanna add an ID to the request itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 248.13,
          "end": 251.3,
          "en": "so that every request object has a new ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 251.3,
          "end": 254.2,
          "en": "And we can simply create a dummy ID for the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 254.2,
          "end": 258.08,
          "en": "by taking the current date and getting a string snapshot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 258.08,
          "end": 259.183,
          "en": "of it, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 260.71,
          "end": 263.01,
          "en": "And with that, we already got all we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 263.01,
          "end": 268.01,
          "en": "Now we can call it context.commit, commit the add, whoops,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 268.07,
          "end": 271.22,
          "en": "the addRequest mutation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 271.22,
          "end": 275.09000000000003,
          "en": "That's the name I chose here in the mutations.JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 275.09000000000003,
          "end": 277.8,
          "en": "And then also pass on our payload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 277.8,
          "end": 280.86,
          "en": "which for me here will just be this new request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 280.86,
          "end": 281.963,
          "en": "we're building here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 283.81,
          "end": 288.81,
          "en": "And that should now add a new request to our requests state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 289.5,
          "end": 293.513,
          "en": "if this action is dispatched with the appropriate payload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.90999999999997,
          "end": 297.61,
          "en": "So now it's up to us to dispatch this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 297.61,
          "end": 302.61,
          "en": "So back in the contactCoach component here in submit form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 303.44,
          "end": 308.44,
          "en": "we now wanna reach out to this store and call dispatch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 310.59,
          "end": 313.673,
          "en": "And then since our module is namedspaced,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 314.58,
          "end": 318.39,
          "en": "it's the requests namespace we have to access,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 318.39,
          "end": 321.6,
          "en": "and therefore it's the requests/contactCoach here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 322.903,
          "end": 324.83,
          "en": "ContactCoach is our actual name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 324.83,
          "end": 326.89300000000003,
          "en": "requests is our namespace name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 328.69,
          "end": 330.73,
          "en": "Now, of course, we need to add some data here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 330.73,
          "end": 333.2,
          "en": "and that data should be this object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 333.2,
          "end": 335.44,
          "en": "which we're extracting here in our action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 335.44,
          "end": 339.15,
          "en": "So we need a coach ID, an email, and a message field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 339.15,
          "end": 341.29,
          "en": "in our payload object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 341.29,
          "end": 344.97,
          "en": "So therefore here, I wanna create a new object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 344.97,
          "end": 348.28,
          "en": "which has an email field pointing at this email,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 348.28,
          "end": 351.67,
          "en": "a message field pointing at this message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 351.67,
          "end": 353.92,
          "en": "and then one other important thing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 353.92,
          "end": 358.59000000000003,
          "en": "the ID of the coach to whom this message is sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 358.59000000000003,
          "end": 362.48,
          "en": "And we can get does ID here because you have to keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 362.48,
          "end": 364.5,
          "en": "that when we contact a coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 364.5,
          "end": 368.283,
          "en": "this URL contains the coach ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 369.26,
          "end": 372.503,
          "en": "So therefore, since this is a child route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 373.986,
          "end": 376.9,
          "en": "the contactCoach component is a child route of coach detail,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 376.9,
          "end": 378.77,
          "en": "which has this ID parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 378.77,
          "end": 381.64,
          "en": "we can extract that here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 381.64,
          "end": 383.92,
          "en": "We could do it with Props to Route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 383.92,
          "end": 386.46,
          "en": "but to also see that other approach you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 386.46,
          "end": 390.16,
          "en": "here in contactCoach, I'll get the ID differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 390.16,
          "end": 394.77,
          "en": "I'll set my coach ID field here to this dollars and route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 394.77,
          "end": 399.37,
          "en": "and then ID because that parameter holds the ID of the coach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 399.37,
          "end": 400.973,
          "en": "to whom this message is sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 403.43,
          "end": 407.13,
          "en": "And that should then dispatch this successfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 407.13,
          "end": 408.42,
          "en": "Now, last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 408.42,
          "end": 411.43,
          "en": "I then also wanna navigate away from this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 411.43,
          "end": 415.40999999999997,
          "en": "So we can do this with this router and then replace maybe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 415.40999999999997,
          "end": 418.32,
          "en": "instead of push so that we can't go back to this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 418.32,
          "end": 421.4,
          "en": "thereafter and go to /coaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 421.4,
          "end": 424.563,
          "en": "But it's up to you where and how you wanna navigate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 425.89,
          "end": 429.24,
          "en": "With that saved, we should now actually be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 429.24,
          "end": 431.37,
          "en": "to send requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 431.37,
          "end": 436.21,
          "en": "So if we contact a coach here and we fill out this form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 436.21,
          "end": 439.41,
          "en": "first of all, if it's invalid, we get an error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 439.41,
          "end": 441.493,
          "en": "But if I fill it out there after,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 443.55,
          "end": 445.17,
          "en": "we at least leave the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 445.17,
          "end": 448.473,
          "en": "but I get an unknown action requests/contactCoach.",
